  (text "ANALOG 0-5V (x4): 12k/20k divider (x0.625, firmware ANALOG_SCALE=1.6), 100nF, BAT54S clamp -> ADS1115 @0x48 (I2C).\n5V in -> 3.125V at ADC, under the 3.3V rail. GND_SENS joins GND only at NT1 (star point near ADC)."
